        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Una gheeh Farao aba gideaba naahang'waanyi gurooroadaanyi ea gurooruunatka fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ak gaydaahiimda gwadeagwajeesu ikeasuun aba bugusta nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ng'asheanji gayrukwiisiina orjeedaang'u ea orjooga orjeedaang'u ng'asheanda easimi fuga Misri ea gwadeagwajeega easinyi aba bugusta nyaawa, ak gaynala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Musa ea Haruni gheeh Farao, ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Ebraniya, ‘Gayheewacheena ea ghoah eeju, ak ea miyaadi geaw ng'eanyi aba madeedeanyu? Siksiina fugeasu gaweay gagadiyeesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas ea misiksiini fugeasu gaweay, ng'ula, numuji gaydanung' ghapka deashamga ng'eanyiidaang'u, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwadukuta badayda ng'eanyiida, ak ea manda eara siyagi jea ghwadaah ng'eanyiida, ak gayghwaak haleanjeeda abit iing'ata roopta ghayi bea lagheanga, ak gayghwaak gilinyoo ea geeta gil ridu aba madamnyeanda was deang'wa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwanyiit jeeda gealgaagu, ea gealga fugaagu sean bea gadiyeeda, ea gea fuga sean bea Misri, ak giduurji nih ea miighwadaah ghweanigaagu ghana gheamba ghweanigaagu ghang'eada deaghayi hina badayda ng'eanyiida ea ghoah ghamneawa.’” Hean ghwayam geaw ak gwarita jarooda aba madeeda Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga gadiyeeda bea Farao ak gwayeesha niny, “Siisi gaygoodeawiideasa ea ghoah eeju? Siksiina fiisu gaweay gagadiiyeesa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa, mii jeeng'ni gideaba Misri ninyar?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta Musa ea Haruni heeda Farao, ak gwayeesha saawa, “Aweayeena agadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak fuga jea gaweay ea geabeang'a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha, “Gajeeweaya sea diibigaasa manang'i ea gweargwaasa, ea orjoagaasa ea haweega ea noagaasa ea dugwaasa, aba gideaba gamiiseasa eesisiina NG'UTAMIIDA ghweelmeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha saawa, “Gagasa andeawana NG'UTAMIIDA, iyeasikseegwa aweayeena sea orjoogeagwa manang'i! Ashageada gwanda madeedeang'wa sawanadeeni mwanang' ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda! Aweayeena headiga aghadoawana NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba gideagasayi gil.” Ak geahoan aba madeeda Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Miinda geatindaang'u aba badayda ng'eanyiida Misri aba deashamga, ak gayghapka ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gayghwaak booga sean aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, gea ghayi abuut roopta lagheanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinda Musa bileangidaanyi aba badayda ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gweadu NG'UTAMIIDA jeameeda leabu gayeew, badayda ng'eanyiida askweari ea eaweesean, iidu nea niiw sakteayda gweadu jeameedida bea sakteaydean deashamga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghapka deashamga badayda ng'eanyiisean bea Misri, ak goobissa ng'eanyiisean bea Misri, ak deashamgiga aasaang'a muuchi, eara heeda ghayi miigwardu ak ea maygabiikta gwardu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwadukuta ng'eanyiisean, ea gamisaniit ng'eanyiisean, nea ghwaak booga sean mida jeeda ng'eanyiida ea haghweega sean bea geediga abuut roopta lagheanga ak ea moapta eara seendoanagi bea geeta ghana booga jeeda madamnyeanda aba ng'eanyiisean bea Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamwach gaguursa Farao Musa ea Haruni ak gwayeesha, “Neasissi riing'eeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ea agooga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaniyean asamsiina riing'eedeanyu, geamuscheegwa eaghus nih asagiin amusa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gageandeawanean miyeeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabeawa Musa heeda Farao, ak gamus NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayam NG'UTAMIIDA jeameeda ak ghwanung' gwaleabu heeda biyeara jeameeda ng'waan, ak ghaghuuta deashamga ak gaweay jeeda basooda Shaamu, nea meapuuda eara deashamayeanjagi aba jeeda ng'eanyiisean bea Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoahang'waay NG'UTAMIIDA guroorooda Farao ea masiksiina diibiga Israeli gaweay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Miinda geatindaang'u ageala humng'eeda, ak gaygamisaniit ng'eanyiida Misri, bwaak ea mudea daah gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinda Musa geatindaanyi nea googeal humng'eeda, ak gwardu misaneeda duu aba ng'eanyiisean bea Misri eawooji samwagu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea madeaha geat buuneeda, nea manda siida asiipteawa heeda mida eawooji samwagu, nea heeda mida fuga sean bea Israeli ea manda misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa Farao Musa, ak gwayeesha, “Aweayeena aghadoawana NG'UTAMIIDA, ooteayeena eara diibigeagwa, nea gisilgeagwa ea noogeagwa goopuusi heeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha, “Gamiiseasa eara ada eesina lukghumeeda ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, ak gajeesisiina lukghumeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara dugwaasa mayghwashiy gajeawaasa, majeepuusiina bwadaw eara buuleeda, mayghwashiy gajeawaasa saawa eabwada NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, ak ea meanali dea jea eabwadana NG'UTAMIIDA geaghus eahita hoowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoahaang'waay NG'UTAMIIDA guroorooda Farao ak ea masiksiina saawa gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Farao ak gwayeesha Musa, “Ng'amwana heedeanyu, ng'ula geaw adagudaadaayeay gicha, inyas gutadaanyi gaymeawa.” ",
